## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- `npm run build`: Memastikan produksi Next.js build sukses tanpa kesalahan TypeScript/JSX.
- `npm run lint`: Memastikan kebersihan dan konsistensi kode UI.

### Manual Verification
- Visual inspection tampilan responsive di desktop (1920x1080) & mobile (375x812).
- Memeriksa kelancaran animasi, empty states, loading state, dan dark/light mode transition.
